# ============================================================
# THE FOUR REALMS — environment configuration
# ============================================================
# The game runs FULLY without any of these. They are optional.
#
# OPTIONAL: AI narrative layer.
# Point this at a small backend proxy YOU control that holds your
# LLM API key server-side and forwards {kind, context} requests,
# returning { "text": "..." }. NEVER put a raw API key in the
# frontend — Vite inlines VITE_* vars into the client bundle, so
# only ever put a PROXY URL here, not a secret.
#
# If unset, the game uses built-in deterministic local flavour text.
VITE_AI_PROXY_URL=
